{"id":"4c912f9b1462f965","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-order11-order-congruence.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Order Congruence","display":"df-zfc-order11-order-congruence — ZFC Order11 Order Congruence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-order-congruence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-order-congruence"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-order-congruence — ZFC Order11 Order Congruence","depends_on":["[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-order-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-order-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-order-congruence — ZFC Order11 Order Congruence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,E\\in V\">\\(P,E\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq P^2\">\\(E\\subseteq P^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S,\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S,\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderCongruence}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderCongruence}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}congruence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderCongruence}_S(E,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\\land\\forall x,y,u,v\\in P\\;\\bigl((\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in E)\\to(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow u\\leq_P v)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}order\\text{-}congruence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderCongruence}_S(E,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)\\land\\forall x,y,u,v\\in P\\;\\bigl((\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,v\\rangle\\in E)\\to(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow u\\leq_P v)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary order congruence definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea